      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"page-width page-width--narrow\">\n<h3>Test & Tag Industry Experts</h3>\n<p>Our Technical Support Team have decades of experience and knowledge to share. They are testing and tagging experts with extensive knowledge of testing equipment and PAT testers. Whether you need help operating your test and tag machine, need advice on how to test an electrical appliance or you’re not sure about the result you are getting, our team is here to help.<p>\n<h3>Dependable Advice </h3>\n<p>We are a Registered Training Organisation that has been rated the #1 test and tag training course provider in Australia for the last 4 years. Our courses are designed to meet the highest industry standard, and we offer exclusive post-course support for our students.</p> \n<p>Our main goal is to ensure that every student of ours is ready to Test and Tag on their own while ensuring the safety of themselves and others. So, you can be sure you will always receive dependable and honest advice. </p>\n<h3>Free for a Lifetime</h3>\n<p>When you take any course with us, you become a student with us for a lifetime. We will be there with you throughout your entire test and tag pathway to help with whatever you may need - with no expiry date.</p>\n<p><strong>This is a completely free service</strong>. You can call us on <a href=\"tel:1300848302\">1300 848 302</a>, <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@testandtagtraining.com.au\">send us an email</a> or <a href=\"/pages/contact\">visit us in person</a> anytime during business hours and we will be there to assist.</p>\n<h3>Support Anywhere in Australia</h3>\n<p>Our team of test and tag experts are available to support you no matter where you reside in Australia. We service every state and know the Australian Standards intimately and how it affects your region. We also have physical offices situated in both Victoria and Western Australia if you prefer to speak to us face-to-face.</p>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
