          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does \"lifetime support\" mean? Is there a time limit or expiry date?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>When you take a course with Test and Tag Training, it comes with Lifetime Technical Support, meaning you can access expert advice whenever you need it. </p><p>We guarantee help is always available to our students. If you’re facing any technical difficulties while using a PAT tester or are unsure of the results you’re getting and want to know how you can interpret them or if there are any industry-specific issues you need guidance with or any other course-related questions, our team is there to answer any sort of questions, for as long as you need it.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_EVTqkG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How can I contact the technical support team? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Our technical support team is available 24/7 during business hours. You can <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\">contact us</a> via phone, email, live chat, or in-person support, whichever is most convenient for you.</p>",
            "page": ""
