        "collapsible_row_8MhWVU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What hours of the day can I contact the support team?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Our commitment to assisting you doesn't stop with business hours. While our regular support hours are Monday to Friday, 8.30 am – 5 pm, we understand that urgent issues can arise anytime. </p><p>If you encounter an urgent matter outside of our regular support hours or during weekends, please don't hesitate to reach out to us via email. You can write to us with your query, concern, or issue, and our dedicated support team will get back to you at the earliest time possible. Rest assured that your concern will not go unnoticed.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6D44GR": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is lifetime support available to students who did the course years ago?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Regardless of when you did the course with us, our dedicated support team is ready to assist you with any inquiries, troubleshooting, or technical assistance you may require. We believe in fostering lasting relationships with our students, so feel free to reach out to us at any time.</p>",
            "page": ""
