          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are there any resources available to help me troubleshoot common test and tag challenges on my own?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Definitely! Our website has plenty of <a href=\"https://ttt-au.myshopify.com/pages/testing-tagging-resources\" title=\"https://ttt-au.myshopify.com/pages/testing-tagging-resources\">Useful Test and tagging Resources</a> that you can refer to anytime. </p><p>We're here to help you on your test and tag pathway and answer any questions you might have. If you need further assistance, feel free to call us.</p>",
